# M3. An offer (ids only; the SIMULATED offer source stands in for a later cloud request) becomes the Confirm
# target, worded by the Pi from the pose's own title. A handle Confirm press accepts it and the arm goes there.
# A second press does nothing: the target is single use.
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key offer-ready-left
expect motion target arm.go_to_pose offer: Move the left arm to ready
expect spoke Move the left arm to ready. Park the walker and lock the brakes, then press Confirm.
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command arm.go_to_pose started offer
expect 5000 motion command arm.go_to_pose completed offer
# Single use: the next Confirm press starts nothing and writes no goal.
wait 2100
key c
absent 1500 motion started
absent 500 sim goal-write left follower
key q
